12.10 Accounting Engine ka central rule
Har posted business transaction ke saath double-entry accounting journal create hogi.

Misal:
Transaction	Debit	Credit
Cash sale	Cash	Sales
Credit sale	Customer Receivable	Sales
Inventory sold	Cost of Goods Sold	Inventory
Customer payment	Cash / Bank	Customer Receivable
Purchase on credit	Inventory	Supplier Payable
Supplier payment	Supplier Payable	Cash / Bank
Expense paid	Expense	Cash / Bank

Tax, discounts, markup aur returns ke accounts configured accounting policy ke mutabiq handle honge.

Important: Stock valuation aur Cost of Goods Sold ka calculation bhi accounting engine se connected hoga. Iske baghair profit report reliable nahi hogi.

